            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; }
  ul { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin: 2px 0; }
</style>
<h3>What's New</h3>
<h2>New Features</h2>
<ul>
<li>Project icons can now be picked from a searchable SF Symbol picker. Choose one from the sidebar&#x27;s project menu or from Project Health.</li>
<li>Added a Close All Panes command (Cmd+Option+W) in the View menu. It closes every pane in the active split and starts a fresh agent in your default agent mode.</li>
<li>Agents can now build custom pane types that draw the same chevron as Addy&#x27;s built-in panes. The MCP tools and IPC handler for custom panes were extended to support this.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>The Project Health view was reworked to share the new icon picker, and the sidebar&#x27;s project icon handling was updated to match.</li>
<li>Custom panes now use the same chevron shape as the rest of the app, so pane headers look consistent.</li>
<li>Close All Panes appears in the Panes category of the keyboard shortcut settings, so you can rebind it.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Bug Fixes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed the default agent mode being stuck on Terminal for settings saved by older versions. Those settings now reset to Chat once, and a Terminal default you choose afterward is kept.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
